+==============================================================================
+ARTIFACT  experiment_3956_goal_predicate_induction.json
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+  verdict          : complete: precision_0.40_recall_1.00
+  flagged_adversarial (stamped): None   |   LIVE re-check: clean
