+------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+  verdict          : complete: m3_efficiency_real_games_pruner_helps
+  flagged_adversarial (stamped): True   |   LIVE re-check: clean
+  duration_s       : 0.9   substrate: offline_air_gapped_arc_agi3_local_environments
+  adversarial flags: none
